# Minimal source release: track LaTeX manuscript sources, their figures,
# and the Python code. Ignore everything else.
# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but still descend into subdirectories...
!*/
# ...and keep these source types:
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.py
!.gitignore
# ...plus the manuscript figures (they accompany the LaTeX):
!paper/figures/*.pdf
!paper/figures/*.png
# ...plus the compiled manuscript and supplement PDFs:
!paper/main.pdf
!paper/supplement.pdf

# (Everything else stays local: results CSVs, docs, working notes and PDFs,
#  build intermediates, and caches.)
